  "changes": [
    "SOPHIE 1.2.0 (tag v1.2.0, 11d2364), imported unchanged: glue.s, digitakt.c, sophie.c and their headers. SOPHIE now describes its SRC and LFO pages for Machine Pages (a cm_ui_v3 page) and renders through its ev_render_voices event, so it patches no firmware site of its own (1.1.13 patched 17).",
    "The author builds 1.2.0 for elekloader's core 3.0. Modwerk compiles the same sources for Core 2.1 and its Machine Pages 1.2 (irpina's 1.1 on Core 2.1), whose cm_ui and cm_knob layout and ev_render_voices signature match the header the author used; the author's README names machine-pages 1.1 as enough. src/digitakt-mk1/core3.h is Machine Pages' copy of that header.",
    "build.json is the author's mod.json: core_machines at order 70, ev_render_voices at order 20, requires machine-pages; the 1.54 release adds -DOS154 and defsym OS154. Source-only exports compiled in the pinned GCC 16.2 Docker toolchain with Modwerk's flags (-mcpu=54455), so the bytes differ from the author's own -mcpu=54415 files."
  ],
